<!doctype lake><title>🐳 𝓓𝓮𝓮𝓹𝓢𝓮𝓮𝓴</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="n1rzY" id="n1rzY" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uce39d8bd" id="uce39d8bd">🐺</span><span data-lake-id="uaf49c129" id="uaf49c129"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4da3097a" id="u4da3097a">𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤𝐌𝐨𝐄: 𝐓𝐨𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝𝐬 𝐔𝐥𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐢𝐧 𝐌𝐢𝐱𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞-𝐨𝐟-𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u89140516" id="u89140516"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5fc717a" id="uf5fc717a">近期研究与实践已通过实证表明，在训练数据充足的条件下，通过增加参数量和计算预算来扩展语言模型规模，可以显著提升模型能力</span></strong></p><ul list="udd83b8b1"><li fid="u5cbbeb76" data-lake-id="u0b176b65" id="u0b176b65"><span data-lake-id="ucba29f62" id="ucba29f62">将模型扩展至极大规模也会带来极高的计算成本。考虑到这一高昂成本，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5828b5cb" id="u5828b5cb" style="color: #004347">混合专家架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucc565928" id="ucc565928">已成为一种广受关注的解决方案。该架构能够在扩展参数规模的同时，将计算成本维持在较低水平</span></li><li fid="u5cbbeb76" data-lake-id="ub027ee4f" id="ub027ee4f"><span data-lake-id="ubcad2998" id="ubcad2998">近年来，将 MoE 架构应用于 Transformer 的研究已成功将语言模型扩展至较大规模，并取得显著的性能表现。这些成果凸显 MoE 语言模型的巨大潜力与发展前景</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8e02bc72" id="u8e02bc72"><strong><span data-lake-id="u185015e0" id="u185015e0">尽管 MoE 架构展现出良好的潜力，现有架构仍可能存在知识混杂与知识冗余问题，限制专家的专业化，即每个专家掌握互不重叠且具有明确侧重的知识。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5ac93b67" id="u5ac93b67">传统 MoE 架构使用 MoE 层替换 Transformer 中的前馈网络。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uae55f0b8" id="uae55f0b8">每个 MoE 层包含多个专家，每个专家在结构上均与标准 FFN 相同，而每个 token 被分配给一个或两个专家。该架构存在两个潜在问题</span></strong></p><ul list="ud28a24a8"><li fid="u04d6309c" data-lake-id="u48625fb3" id="u48625fb3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b0d7194" id="u5b0d7194">知识混杂</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6409dc15" id="u6409dc15">：现有 MoE 实践通常采用数量有限的专家，例如 8 个或 16 个，因此，分配给某个专家的 token 很可能涵盖多种不同的知识。由此，该专家会倾向于将差异较大的多类知识整合到自身参数中，而这些知识难以被同时利用</span></li><li fid="u04d6309c" data-lake-id="u6ed44ef5" id="u6ed44ef5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11355412" id="u11355412">知识冗余</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9cdc33b6" id="u9cdc33b6">：分配给不同专家的 token 可能需要共通知识。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue801c4a8" id="ue801c4a8" style="color: #5C0036">因此，多个专家可能最终在各自的参数中学习到相同的共通知识，从而造成专家参数的冗余</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0824a0a9" id="u0824a0a9">。这些问题共同阻碍现有 MoE 实践中的专家专业化，使其无法达到 MoE 模型理论上的性能上限</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue26217c5" id="ue26217c5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e4343b7" id="u2e4343b7">针对上述问题，作者提出 DeepSeekMoE，一种旨在实现极致专家专业化的创新 MoE 架构。该架构包含两项主要策略</span></strong></p><ul list="uf99bc331"><li fid="ue4085b2d" data-lake-id="uc0ba4829" id="uc0ba4829"><strong><span data-lake-id="u28dd1a17" id="u28dd1a17">细粒度专家划分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf1e2f7fe" id="uf1e2f7fe">：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c931547" id="u3c931547" style="color: #5C0036">在保持参数量不变的前提下，通过拆分 FFN 的中间隐藏维度，将专家划分为更细的粒度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u75522dc7" id="u75522dc7">。相应地，在保持计算成本不变的条件下，激活更多细粒度专家，从而使被激活专家的组合更加灵活、适应性更强。细粒度专家划分使不同知识能够得到更细致的分解，并由不同专家更精确地学习，从而使每个专家保持更高的专业化水平。此外，被激活专家组合方式的灵活性提升，也有助于实现更准确、更有针对性的知识获取</span></li><li fid="ue4085b2d" data-lake-id="u1c3255ed" id="u1c3255ed"><strong><span data-lake-id="u93489569" id="u93489569">共享专家隔离</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8e6e7b89" id="u8e6e7b89">：将部分专家单独划分为始终激活的共享专家，旨在捕获并整合不同上下文中的共通知识。通过将共通知识压缩到这些共享专家中，可以减少其余路由专家之间的冗余。这能够提高参数效率，并使每个路由专家通过专注于各自独特的方面而保持专业化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3cb5a503" id="u3cb5a503"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f742b2e" id="u6f742b2e">作者首先从参数量为 2B 的较小规模出发，验证 DeepSeekMoE 架构的优势，并在涵盖不同任务的 12 个零样本或少样本基准上进行评估</span></strong></p><ul list="ub73331cc"><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="u9bb44716" id="u9bb44716"><span data-lake-id="u72eff2e3" id="u72eff2e3">DeepSeekMoE 2B 显著优于 GShard 2B，甚至能够达到更大规模 MoE 模型 GShard 2.9B 的性能水平，而后者的专家参数量和计算量均为其 1.5 倍</span></li><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="u2d265dcb" id="u2d265dcb"><span data-lake-id="udaa6079f" id="udaa6079f">值得关注的是，作者发现 DeepSeekMoE 2B 的性能已接近参数量相同的对应稠密模型，而后者构成 MoE 语言模型的严格性能上界</span></li><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="ud5b82164" id="ud5b82164"><span data-lake-id="u724dbf24" id="u724dbf24">基于该架构，作者进一步将模型参数规模扩展至 16B，并在包含 2T token 的大规模语料上训练 DeepSeekMoE 16B。评估结果表明，DeepSeekMoE 16B 仅使用约 40% 的计算量，即可达到与 DeepSeek 7B 相当的性能，后者是在相同 2T token 语料上训练的稠密模型</span></li><li fid="u2ac234fb" data-lake-id="u1ac89d25" id="u1ac89d25"><span data-lake-id="ue3fb1cbb" id="ue3fb1cbb">作者还将 DeepSeekMoE 与开源模型进行比较。评估结果表明，DeepSeekMoE 16B 持续大幅优于激活参数量相近的模型，并取得与 LLaMA2 7B 相当的性能，而后者的激活参数量约为其 2.5 倍</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="G8no5" id="G8no5" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue32ec5ff" id="ue32ec5ff">🐗</span><span data-lake-id="u7a58e2cd" id="u7a58e2cd"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬: 𝐌𝐢𝐱𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞-𝐨𝐟-𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue1f548d7" id="ue1f548d7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf01d04f6" id="uf01d04f6">标准 Transformer 语言模型由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97a65d824ef5766184877c3f711d3e69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tXqmO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaef4f35e" id="uaef4f35e">层标准 Transformer 块堆叠构成，其中每个块可表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u16b65614" id="u16b65614" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSelf-Att%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb053c619c0a070af53a5b9c7597c421c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ewitD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7901c142" id="u7901c142" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52f3920bf3de0cd93c1994a6c1e1299f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AG3ue%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8c0df2eb"><li fid="uabd7c765" data-lake-id="ude267119" id="ude267119"><span data-lake-id="u9144081b" id="u9144081b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1553dae3cc5c15cddb4f5b5a367b0aba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F6ykP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f10c29f" id="u3f10c29f">表示序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSelf-Att%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9eb2f4f0f7be40424477661041869585.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vHm2s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u931c88e6" id="u931c88e6">表示自注意力模块，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b8d0d7ec3ac9ebffa78499c9a225996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VrO0j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91ba9623" id="u91ba9623">表示前馈网络（FFN），</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BT%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F847aa8c477badbf37de779e7b24befe6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YRqX8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4febc50a" id="u4febc50a">是所有 token 经过第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DYsJT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa404793" id="uaa404793">层注意力模块后的隐藏状态，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd2e9563a1ea511c1f45231c66c7e300.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h2cRu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u876bc726" id="u876bc726">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uAGjR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44f3909c" id="u44f3909c">个 token 经过第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zFrCB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3543638d" id="u3543638d">个 Transformer 块后的输出隐藏状态</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0a98f64e" id="u0a98f64e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8d611d2" id="ud8d611d2">构建 MoE 语言模型的常见做法是，按指定间隔将 Transformer 中的 FFN 替换为 MoE 层。一个 MoE 层由多个专家组成，其中每个专家在结构上均与标准 FFN 相同。随后，每个 token 被分配给一个或两个专家。如果第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uJH8A%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u35a09d8a" id="u35a09d8a">层 FFN 被替换为 MoE 层，则其输出隐藏状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f01565cda3c994e4a4f808e7717d7c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tQtMX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4b361598" id="u4b361598">的计算表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue4f05c39" id="ue4f05c39" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F637f67b8acb4f8dbffc17099788ff9ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EFv7o%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u81029fdc" id="u81029fdc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20N%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20K%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f521b54c255c961cedf0ffbe323a2c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FdmdZ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub604f0bb" id="ub604f0bb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7BlT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F954febfd6c1ae989e10809ce21fc6930.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H6djy%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u370cf7ed"><li fid="u7a734778" data-lake-id="u315dd0d8" id="u315dd0d8"><span data-lake-id="u90e6bbee" id="u90e6bbee">​</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tUAQ2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueca010b0" id="ueca010b0">表示专家总数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05979e6069a3d6bd13972621c9337d96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wt65i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28291d3a" id="u28291d3a">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kVG3H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua00f4048" id="ua00f4048">个专家的 FFN，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F833ee9318bf92b409adb9bd06a8bac13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zdQ88%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5ac69de" id="ua5ac69de">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AEHuD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ad7939f" id="u6ad7939f">个专家的门控值，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrOhG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2539a56f" id="u2539a56f">表示 token 与专家之间的亲和度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%20K)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F309a9068640ab746b9af4dc3e93071ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XJ4Dm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5928287c" id="u5928287c">表示由第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd99979941e2b40b5ffd75f89c83e37b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X1QLm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud146e805" id="ud146e805">个 token 与所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eacUd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e2835ad" id="u3e2835ad">个专家之间计算得到的亲和度得分中最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22edllw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86a6e35e" id="u86a6e35e">个得分所构成的集合，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe684015cfa4504b9aea3c249fdfd581a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fH7l2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6018cb81" id="u6018cb81">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2086b3e9a86ae9cf4579cb1fa00957f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22biQGw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17f9bb0e" id="u17f9bb0e">层中第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eSH9j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44084734" id="u44084734">个专家的质心</span></li><li fid="u7a734778" data-lake-id="u464ec801" id="u464ec801"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F833ee9318bf92b409adb9bd06a8bac13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MEQkN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d85e7b9" id="u0d85e7b9">是稀疏的，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l7RWj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9eba3bc6" id="u9eba3bc6">个门控值中仅有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X6ZB9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7c087fe" id="ud7c087fe">个非零值。这种稀疏性保证 MoE 层内的计算效率，即每个 token 仅被分配给</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9tyM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud476b4b0" id="ud476b4b0">个专家，并仅在这</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kusnO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee5f7030" id="uee5f7030">个专家中进行计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e1074a8" id="u0e1074a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790601418301-31aee22c-9869-4c5f-8d5a-36fb608a1c5f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u06cd1294-68e3-45c1-84de-69ce770d8c3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u29fb42ae-844d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A753%2C%22height%22%3A388%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A484128%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1516%2C%22originHeight%22%3A781%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A338%2C%22width%22%3A1013%2C%22height%22%3A83%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)%2BFINE-GRAINEDEXPERTSEGMENTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A502%2C%22y%22%3A702%2C%22width%22%3A504%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)CONVENTIONALTOP-2ROUTING%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A700%2C%22width%22%3A375%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)%2BSHAREDEXPERTLSOLATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1065%2C%22y%22%3A700%2C%22width%22%3A345%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDENOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1042%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHAREDEXPERT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1331%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEKMOE)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1121%2C%22y%22%3A735%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A1055%2C%22y%22%3A630%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTEDEXPERT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1326%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A545%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1307%2C%22y%22%3A551%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A557%2C%22y%22%3A635%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A626%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1204%2C%22y%22%3A613%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A191%2C%22y%22%3A615%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A1152%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A238%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A216%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1208%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A627%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A814%2C%22y%22%3A557%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%3D2%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5ec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u909d93f6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="pRmSW" id="pRmSW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uf69f21bf" id="uf69f21bf">🌠</span><span data-lake-id="u81bb5359" id="u81bb5359"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤𝐌𝐨𝐄 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf8a6ea62" id="uf8a6ea62"><strong><span data-lake-id="udec5ff7b" id="udec5ff7b">在专家数量有限的情况下，分配给某个专家的 token 更可能涵盖多种类型的知识。因此，该专家会倾向于在其参数中学习差异很大的多类知识，而这些知识难以被同时利用。</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a0f5d6d" id="u7a0f5d6d" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，如果每个 token 能够被路由至更多专家，不同知识就有可能被分解，并分别由不同专家学习</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue004a35d" id="ue004a35d">。在这种情况下，每个专家仍可保持较高的专业化水平，从而使各专家的知识分布更有侧重</span></strong></p><ul list="u97b471e6"><li fid="uf4070a72" data-lake-id="u9c6383af" id="u9c6383af"><span data-lake-id="u89a06f3b" id="u89a06f3b">作者在保持专家参数量和计算成本不变的同时，对专家进行更细粒度的划分。更细粒度的专家划分使被激活专家的组合更加灵活、适应性更强</span></li><li fid="uf4070a72" data-lake-id="u034f8e5f" id="u034f8e5f"><span data-lake-id="u60089fbb" id="u60089fbb">通过将 FFN 的中间隐藏维度缩减至原来的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bm%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37468e4c0b9aa3f7401a58b848fa5375.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y7Gw3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c35b19f" id="u4c35b19f">，将每个专家 FFN 划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a0b33465cb6a9a84504f60af049255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p966t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8712f389" id="u8712f389">个更小的专家。由于每个专家的规模变小，作者相应地将激活专家的数量增加至原来的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a0b33465cb6a9a84504f60af049255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fji89%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40499141" id="u40499141">倍，以保持相同的计算成本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u06af147f" id="u06af147f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BmN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7646f10dec662c679392f5d4e065e6ae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lO97P%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u011cac9e" id="u011cac9e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20mN%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20mK%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F110404427644b57bf7356573b540d1a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tqxtd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u160d3e78" id="u160d3e78" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7BlT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffdbc0ec938639858853db815c9a3a6e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rzv6r%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u70a331c6" id="u70a331c6"><span data-lake-id="u2c8e13ca" id="u2c8e13ca">​</span><br></p><ul list="uf2b5c69a"><li fid="u028486d1" data-lake-id="u43501ef3" id="u43501ef3"><span data-lake-id="ufd5c6a32" id="ufd5c6a32">其中，专家参数总量等于标准 FFN 参数量的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zEyi7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6e6bfc2" id="uc6e6bfc2">倍，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mN%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1b04309ea93c64373ac51325beb215a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DacEf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0de67b60" id="u0de67b60">表示细粒度专家的总数。采用细粒度专家划分策略后，非零门控值的数量也增加至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20mK%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F49f4ee326b64c7fdd30da5b162fde00a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DUa23%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u028486d1" data-lake-id="u36683db9" id="u36683db9"><span data-lake-id="udb86dcd9" id="udb86dcd9">从组合的角度来看，细粒度专家划分策略显著提高被激活专家的组合灵活性。考虑</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%20%3D%2016%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0a1f6e1dcf55642a5aa86bf9e2721a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AImSN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e5fe5e9" id="u9e5fe5e9">的情况。典型的 top-2 路由策略可以产生</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbinom%7B16%7D%7B2%7D%20%3D%20120%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52c6a5ec847563b6c21b0afd9193af2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RiKaM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91f82e2b" id="u91f82e2b">种可能的组合。相比之下，如果将每个专家划分为 4 个小专家，细粒度路由策略可以产</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbinom%7B64%7D%7B8%7D%20%3D%204%7B%2C%7D426%7B%2C%7D165%7B%2C%7D368%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9e0bddcdbbd26324a7eac88d4a08d54e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22teXRX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1fa969a1" id="u1fa969a1">种潜在组合。组合灵活性的大幅提升，增强实现更准确、更有针对性的知识获取的潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4353c392" id="u4353c392"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c1470c2" id="u4c1470c2">采用传统路由策略时，分配给不同专家的 token 可能需要某些共通的知识或信息。因此，多个专家可能最终在各自的参数中学习到相同的共享知识，从而造成专家参数冗余。然而，如果设置专门用于捕获和整合不同上下文中共通知识的共享专家，其他路由专家之间的参数冗余就会得到缓解。冗余的减少将有助于构建参数效率更高、专家更加专业化的模型</span></strong></p><ul list="uaaaa5e52"><li fid="u8a4f2e70" data-lake-id="ua1fa0864" id="ua1fa0864"><span data-lake-id="u76a81522" id="u76a81522">除细粒度专家划分策略外，作者进一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F768d8fbf5b8122c21c31fafda0e505b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrr4Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2248d9e2" id="u2248d9e2">个专家单独划分为共享专家。无论路由模块如何，每个 token 都会确定性地被分配给这些共享专家。为保持计算成本不变，其余路由专家中被激活的专家数量将减少</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F768d8fbf5b8122c21c31fafda0e505b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lYxFZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u358e85a6" id="u358e85a6">。引入共享专家隔离策略后，完整 DeepSeekMoE 架构中的 MoE 层可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6e8d2b4d" id="u6e8d2b4d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BK_s%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3DK_s%2B1%7D%5E%7BmN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd675fb0357e5bf7c798ed7b0b1f24ef3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yA4c4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u562c8cd6" id="u562c8cd6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20K_s%20%2B%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20mN%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20mK%20-%20K_s%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcc86b3273b96ab430ce3553a0f6b613.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EXkyI%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u533e5c33" id="u533e5c33" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7Bt%7D%5E%7BlT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7Bl%7D%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b8c250f88126958444648803ef4fb63.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gxZkw%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc51d525b"><li fid="uc39984a4" data-lake-id="u0fb0d276" id="u0fb0d276"><span data-lake-id="ub41863b4" id="ub41863b4">在 DeepSeekMoE 中，共享专家的数量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F768d8fbf5b8122c21c31fafda0e505b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22waX8M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8be13a2" id="ub8be13a2">，路由专家的总数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mN%20-%20K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc579f5380354543e430f457bf983ce5b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N95Wd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79d29c12" id="u79d29c12">，非零门控值的数量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mK%20-%20K_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4678ff13feffe34d6d0fe453a3a22cf2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AUb3D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6882089f" id="u6882089f">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud35733db" id="ud35733db"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5df633ef" id="u5df633ef">自动学习得到的路由策略可能遇到负载不均衡问题，这一问题存在两个明显弊端。首先，存在路由坍塌的风险，即模型始终只选择少数专家，导致其他专家无法得到充分训练。其次，如果专家分布在多个设备上，负载不均衡可能加剧计算瓶颈</span></strong></p><ul list="uaec2eefc"><li fid="u1c16b9e6" data-lake-id="u45c94f50" id="u45c94f50"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0d15d1c" id="ue0d15d1c">专家级均衡损失：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf3b7a4d8" id="uf3b7a4d8">为降低路由坍塌的风险，作者还采用专家级均衡损失。该均衡损失的计算如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa22c12c" id="uaa22c12c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BExpBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_1%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN'%7D%20f_i%20P_i%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd96c01bc8f3ef8ced48d5f8a4045e9f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IsOaO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue0f6bb48" id="ue0f6bb48" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BN'%7D%7BK'T%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctext%7BToken%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20selects%20Expert%20%7D%20i%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d17533c0016391a50abf8e3f5671cf5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22naizl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue66565b5" id="ue66565b5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa68cdf4078bb235dba19d62ebe2788b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mz355%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufaff2a33"><li fid="u42fce1de" data-lake-id="u71b92b8b" id="u71b92b8b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac03d0e7" id="uac03d0e7">设备级均衡损失：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4dad7766" id="u4dad7766">除专家级均衡损失外，作者还引入设备级均衡损失。当目标是缓解计算瓶颈时，无须在专家层面施加严格的均衡约束，因为过度的负载均衡约束会损害模型性能。作者的主要目标是确保设备之间的计算均衡。如果将所有路由专家划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V14iF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60264e51" id="u60264e51">组 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_1%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_2%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F530e0038f6bfe6bbb89f01b44a90e55e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RD7Vo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u064c7da5" id="u064c7da5">，并将每组部署在一个设备上，则设备级均衡损失的计算如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9b5f1250" id="u9b5f1250" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDevBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_2%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BD%7D%20f_i'%20P_i'%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F836ce01c34caa6a8ae476077c9a60c0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22svzGt%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u29ae454c" id="u29ae454c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20f_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6fae84c8ef6cf0f1130c124a09307a56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lBp3P%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ude25177d" id="ude25177d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i'%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20P_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc615c9910f1d5ab782d5d60e8d2ef502.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qttuK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucdff55f6"><li fid="ud33be319" data-lake-id="u1d5d4982" id="u1d5d4982"><span data-lake-id="u61e44b52" id="u61e44b52">在实践中，作者设置较小的专家级均衡因子，以降低路由坍塌的风险，同时设置较大的设备级均衡因子，以促进设备之间的计算均衡</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="Q3wVh" id="Q3wVh" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua15c8f3c" id="ua15c8f3c">🐻</span><span data-lake-id="uace7db30" id="uace7db30"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐕𝟐: 𝐀 𝐒𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐠, 𝐄𝐜𝐨𝐧𝐨𝐦𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐥, 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐌𝐢𝐱𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞-𝐨𝐟-𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ud803d279" id="ud803d279"><span data-lake-id="u86742625" id="u86742625">通常，LLM 的智能水平会随着参数量的增加而提升，使其在各类任务中展现出涌现能力。然而，这种提升的代价是训练所需的计算资源增加，以及推理吞吐量可能下降。这些约束构成重大挑战，阻碍 LLM 的广泛采用与应用</span></p><ul list="u8af0f210"><li fid="ud4ddb748" data-lake-id="u2d152ee8" id="u2d152ee8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf325f3d6" id="uf325f3d6">为解决这一问题，作者提出 DeepSeek-V2，一种性能强大的开源混合专家语言模型，通过创新的 Transformer 架构实现低成本训练与高效推理。该模型的总参数量为 236B，每个 token 激活其中的 21B 参数，并支持 128K token 的上下文长度</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u26bbd217" id="u26bbd217"><span data-lake-id="u2db45fa1" id="u2db45fa1">作者使用所提出的多头潜在注意力和 DeepSeekMoE，对 Transformer 框架中的注意力模块和前馈网络进行优化</span></p><ul list="u86f4af17"><li fid="u825e82be" data-lake-id="u4c5fd11a" id="u4c5fd11a"><span data-lake-id="ubd971f0c" id="ubd971f0c">在注意力机制方面，多头注意力的键值缓存是制约 LLM 推理效率的重要因素。已有研究探索多种解决方法，包括分组查询注意力和多查询注意力。然而，这些方法在尝试减少 KV 缓存时，往往会牺牲模型性能。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8c7efb4" id="ud8c7efb4" style="color: #5C0036">为兼顾二者，作者提出 MLA，一种采用键值联合低秩压缩的注意力机制。实证结果表明，MLA 的性能优于 MHA，同时显著减少推理过程中的 KV 缓存，从而提高推理效率</span></strong></li><li fid="u825e82be" data-lake-id="u760791be" id="u760791be"><span data-lake-id="u7f2106b2" id="u7f2106b2">对于前馈网络，作者沿用 DeepSeekMoE 架构，该架构采用细粒度专家划分和共享专家隔离，以提高专家专业化的潜力。与 GShard 等传统 MoE 架构相比，DeepSeekMoE 架构展现出显著优势，使得以较低成本训练高性能模型成为可能</span></li><li fid="u825e82be" data-lake-id="u49de7865" id="u49de7865"><strong><span data-lake-id="u28058b88" id="u28058b88" style="color: #5C0036">由于训练过程中采用专家并行，作者还设计辅助机制，以控制通信开销并确保负载均衡。通过结合这两项技术，DeepSeek-V2 同时具备强大的性能、较低的训练成本和高效的推理吞吐量</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u839ff8a4" id="u839ff8a4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6413a9b0" id="u6413a9b0">作者构建一个包含 8.1T token 的高质量、多来源预训练语料库</span></strong></p><ul list="u35228826"><li fid="ua0136ba8" data-lake-id="u22ff8088" id="u22ff8088"><span data-lake-id="ud89c36bc" id="ud89c36bc">与作者此前发布的 DeepSeek 67B 所使用的语料相比，该语料库的数据量更大，尤其增加中文数据，同时具有更高的数据质量</span></li><li fid="ua0136ba8" data-lake-id="u29529b40" id="u29529b40"><span data-lake-id="u41ffce39" id="u41ffce39">作者首先使用完整的预训练语料库对 DeepSeek-V2 进行预训练。随后，收集 150 万段对话，涵盖数学、代码、写作、推理、安全等多个领域，用于进行监督微调，得到 DeepSeek-V2 Chat (SFT)</span></li><li fid="ua0136ba8" data-lake-id="ufcf03f08" id="ufcf03f08"><span data-lake-id="udbec8f30" id="udbec8f30">作者沿用 DeepSeekMath（Shao et al., 2024）的方法，采用组相对策略优化，进一步使模型与人类偏好对齐，得到 DeepSeek-V2 Chat (RL)</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u88c6dc1e" id="u88c6dc1e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u48c31570" id="u48c31570">为促进对 MLA 和 DeepSeekMoE 的进一步研究与开发，作者还面向开源社区发布 DeepSeek-V2-Lite，这是一个采用 MLA 和 DeepSeekMoE 的较小规模模型。其总参数量为 15.7B，每个 token 激活其中的 2.4B 参数</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="pTUbj" id="pTUbj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1e99d033" id="u1e99d033">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="u5035c6a7" id="u5035c6a7"> 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢-𝐇𝐞𝐚𝐝 𝐋𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: 𝐁𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u1e434e80" id="u1e434e80"><span data-lake-id="uec00abfa" id="uec00abfa">传统 Transformer 模型通常采用多头注意力，但在生成过程中，其庞大的键值缓存会成为限制推理效率的瓶颈。为减少 KV 缓存，研究者提出多查询注意力和分组查询注意力。这两种方法所需的 KV 缓存更少，但性能不及 MHA</span></p><ul list="ube976449"><li fid="u3b83937b" data-lake-id="uf8ce6977" id="uf8ce6977"><strong><span data-lake-id="u234d05c2" id="u234d05c2" style="color: #DF2A3F">针对 DeepSeek-V2，作者设计一种创新的注意力机制，称为多头潜在注意力。通过采用键值联合低秩压缩，MLA 取得优于 MHA 的性能，同时所需的 KV 缓存显著减少</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u62da9914" id="u62da9914"><span data-lake-id="u59d89c4d" id="u59d89c4d">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fnUoc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub85334c0" id="ub85334c0">为嵌入维度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c3e4ad6127db0eaa2934769e2098781.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22chd4E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u031ea19d" id="u031ea19d">为注意力头数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a51260b8293a322049a4a40cc888982.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vQiTH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u489edb48" id="u489edb48">为每个头的维度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F37e5c66ec276f364aaff2c7b1c0470d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sph1K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua91cfed6" id="ua91cfed6">为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B0UH5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51d9dc7c" id="u51d9dc7c">个 token 在某个注意力层中的注意力输入。标准 MHA 首先分别通过三个矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5EQ%2C%20W%5EK%2C%20W%5EV%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%20n_h%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4e8ca31247f035a92166d917204c9000.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PEf5x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee4dc1e1" id="uee4dc1e1">，生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%20n_h%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0c091aeaf5b3dd3a20d79e19dad4881.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FfKCm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubce0d188" id="ubce0d188">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="u07345c9d" id="u07345c9d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%20%3D%20W%5EQ%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8178401fb1e3605985674b8779fba5d6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sMLgS%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub3c235fd" id="ub3c235fd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%20%3D%20W%5EK%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6f6aa399735c62180740678aad0ed39.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pj5Oa%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u38e2ef78" id="u38e2ef78" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%20%3D%20W%5EV%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e0eb137b69581087d7703c000349803.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BLZx2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u682c89a7"><li fid="u76a9f537" data-lake-id="u52c6de75" id="u52c6de75"><span data-lake-id="u820d362f" id="u820d362f">随后，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3971dd85e4789182acc34352cb6aa1e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i6EgE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udeca3ce2" id="udeca3ce2">分别划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c3e4ad6127db0eaa2934769e2098781.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kAwqx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud31e20ad" id="ud31e20ad">个头，以进行多头注意力计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2377653d" id="u2377653d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1fcdc765a299fca385675a232aa52ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uY1VU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc5d16de4" id="uc5d16de4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa27089cd9619b38878060292f1ec93fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rEjJ7%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucefebb35" id="ucefebb35" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88c4cb379bf60b6953da94d209c00e08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hKy26%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufae820f8" id="ufae820f8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd_h%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b774731cd45cb396ba181055903f276.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d02Mq%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3f760f3e" id="u3f760f3e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%20%3D%20W%5EO%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4dd75e0c8319c2b655e654fabf0e3707.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vbxvs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1a95fcac"><li fid="uc19950c1" data-lake-id="u2963f140" id="u2963f140"><span data-lake-id="uf4ad4cb4" id="uf4ad4cb4">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F828f74609304964359fceff5f1530c06.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N2WIx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47290a90" id="u47290a90">分别表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CkXoi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucffe3fb5" id="ucffe3fb5">个注意力头的查询、键和值；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5EO%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_h%20n_h%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2d62c0cff0b2e28090ad6b534157856.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22slaWt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d2d9977" id="u1d2d9977">表示输出投影矩阵。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u52f1a67a" id="u52f1a67a" style="color: #5C0036">在推理过程中，为加速推理，需要缓存所有键和值，因此 MHA 需要为每个 token 缓存</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222n_h%20d_h%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faaa015e92efdfe50305984cd6e81c667.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bo4v7%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u60ba3a10" id="u60ba3a10" style="color: #5C0036">个元素。在模型部署时，庞大的 KV 缓存是限制最大批量大小和序列长度的重要瓶颈</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueaa52696" id="ueaa52696"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0cf9d903" id="u0cf9d903" style="color: #000000">MLA 的核心是对键和值进行联合低秩压缩，以减少 KV 缓存</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u72c93818" id="u72c93818" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%20%3D%20W%5E%7BDKV%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F874b2f8fee57eedcbccac6ccb24c7b03.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GASIC%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf8e238d2" id="uf8e238d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5EC%20%3D%20W%5E%7BUK%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8fee828a81a5e16e30b74232bbe538c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22URedy%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u45264890" id="u45264890" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5EC%20%3D%20W%5E%7BUV%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff490f8db9e82c54caccf462a112eeaad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qhdCt%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua198d309"><li fid="u4d27f508" data-lake-id="udcefbca5" id="udcefbca5"><span data-lake-id="u9d51a119" id="u9d51a119">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_c%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28dd54619603e004945c9b24259709b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mlvFS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6251d9a1" id="u6251d9a1">是键和值的压缩潜在向量；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71a3ef7ff0dc8c4e37a6976af50944f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qavyQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ab6aa1b" id="u9ab6aa1b">表示 KV 压缩维度，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_c%20%5C%5Cll%20d_h%20n_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae3abcae53599c14decd9ab43aa0afc3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MvdfT%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u4d27f508" data-lake-id="ue2fa62fa" id="ue2fa62fa"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BDKV%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_c%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc567ea4032c4dde3446394fce481e968.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CetGq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3cb900ed" id="u3cb900ed">是下投影矩阵；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUK%7D%2C%20W%5E%7BUV%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%20n_h%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_c%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F572277bc56bf2af5f8e06f049c1bf77f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RmXkD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc85d20c7" id="uc85d20c7">分别是键和值的上投影矩阵</span></li><li fid="u4d27f508" data-lake-id="u72b1d828" id="u72b1d828"><strong><span data-lake-id="u01c07fe8" id="u01c07fe8" style="color: #4C16B1">在推理过程中，MLA 只需缓存</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5E%7BKV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83414d50342d9b0ba1581e64daf01a8e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nV7Sq%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a5ea106" id="u6a5ea106" style="color: #4C16B1">，因此其 KV 缓存仅包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_c%20l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a9fb2c311cee3a5c77adb22b9d24c44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z6sGD%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u917d63f5" id="u917d63f5" style="color: #4C16B1">个元素，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JjD27%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue702560d" id="ue702560d" style="color: #4C16B1">表示层数。此外，在推理过程中，由于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ccd4c448bdc22962fd306a09591be36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udvyv%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u74484cd8" id="u74484cd8" style="color: #4C16B1">可以被吸收到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5EQ%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83e813a7643e1459d320cd2021e1e034.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yy0yk%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u57377402" id="u57377402" style="color: #4C16B1"> 中，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUV%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f48f2b39b3169f406c0b9c9c5d53bdd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GndSJ%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u904d99c3" id="u904d99c3" style="color: #4C16B1">可以被吸收到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5EO%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d6d7061b6d764362fc434f6e45d7fff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KNhP2%22%7D" style="color: #4C16B1"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ac4deee" id="u8ac4deee" style="color: #4C16B1">中，因此甚至无须显式计算注意力所需的键和值。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub29301c8" id="ub29301c8">此外，为减少训练过程中的激活内存占用，作者还对查询进行低秩压缩，尽管这无法减少 KV 缓存</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u29734293" id="u29734293" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%20%3D%20W%5E%7BDQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde622d7ceb59aa0e5061e766d76441df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YDjtd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6f18d01b" id="u6f18d01b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5EC%20%3D%20W%5E%7BUQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9b4ed254a986f1618da55366d5523d1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rn4HO%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u09e28681"><li fid="u4e6ed303" data-lake-id="u9423651e" id="u9423651e"><span data-lake-id="u215a7972" id="u215a7972">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_c'%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfdef71af26e068c3719930bcaf9b4cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xhfpz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ec8ade9" id="u3ec8ade9">是查询的压缩潜在向量；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_c'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbdda524241a3fd1e6a264ae5d5d2682f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IKfoD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud01f9665" id="ud01f9665">表示查询压缩维度，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_c'%20%5C%5Cll%20d_h%20n_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8daf88d6ebd4b7259cead985c4928766.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tc50X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uedeae987" id="uedeae987">；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BDQ%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_c'%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa805805e47dc74801349d46b1095b6a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QeqBc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb89ff8d" id="ucb89ff8d">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUQ%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%20n_h%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_c'%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9941300670473ac800d5d26e24f67eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uLWtc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua40114e7" id="ua40114e7">分别是查询的下投影矩阵和上投影矩阵</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uba44fd2d" id="uba44fd2d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5add5c8b" id="u5add5c8b">RoPE 与 KV 低秩压缩不兼容。具体而言，RoPE 对键和查询都具有位置敏感性。如果对键</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5EC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14b12b8f3ed3131f4b9a91d69f4fc480.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nz0RP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c7b2db6" id="u0c7b2db6">应用 RoPE，式中的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ccd4c448bdc22962fd306a09591be36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vihPq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u537c85e3" id="u537c85e3">就会与一个位置敏感的 RoPE 矩阵耦合。这样，在推理过程中，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ccd4c448bdc22962fd306a09591be36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YwfN7%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2545d726" id="u2545d726">就无法再被吸收到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5EQ%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83e813a7643e1459d320cd2021e1e034.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bbg3b%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf383acf3" id="uf383acf3">中，因为一个与当前正在生成的 token 相关的 RoPE 矩阵会位于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5EQ%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83e813a7643e1459d320cd2021e1e034.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k8I0i%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3428440" id="uc3428440">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BUK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ccd4c448bdc22962fd306a09591be36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GAsI1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u48f47c2b" id="u48f47c2b">之间，而矩阵乘法不满足交换律。因此，推理过程中必须重新计算所有前缀 token 的键，这会显著降低推理效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u13365daf"><li fid="u5c303ced" data-lake-id="u70f088ea" id="u70f088ea"><span data-lake-id="u8c16dc1b" id="u8c16dc1b">为解决这一问题，作者提出解耦 RoPE 策略，使用额外的多头查询</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5ER%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%5ER%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e9798e024ef5b03c96bcc062c67ac64.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xUR1W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57757125" id="u57757125">和一个共享键</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5ER%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%5ER%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d0ae9aeb59dcca8212cb06fcca5308a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YwwPQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f7fd9b9" id="u9f7fd9b9">来承载 RoPE，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_h%5ER%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F478809af2be8355e0e8c29e84e563240.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eutBr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad8b654e" id="uad8b654e">表示解耦查询和键的每头维度。采用解耦 RoPE 策略后，MLA 执行如下计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud4b5ebbb" id="ud4b5ebbb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%5ER%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%5ER%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5ER%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5ER%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoPE%7D%5C%5Cleft(W%5E%7BQR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_t%5EQ%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9fb29e46561eb569bac30290dea149fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FO80r%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua1706dc3" id="ua1706dc3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5ER%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoPE%7D%5C%5Cleft(W%5E%7BKR%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f46c27bad3a35c5cfb29fd4ae9b3173.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ncom2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udeff28ff" id="udeff28ff" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5EC%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5ER%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf4f9932ea6de74607b01b532e2ff315.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ghvbW%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u17ac5960" id="u17ac5960" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5EC%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5ER%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30c220f4b64c4f2aa88a5f7b18d841ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hZTZx%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u04348926" id="u04348926" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bj%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Ci%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd_h%20%2B%20d_h%5ER%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_%7Bj%2Ci%7D%5E%7BC%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc73cdfefdd2af45279ad3ee87d7b2282.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mfFbN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf1244454" id="uf1244454" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%20%3D%20W%5EO%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2C1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2C2%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cldots%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_%7Bt%2Cn_h%7D%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41da1addef9b786fac179e2cb9b270e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bjOkU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7fe8f33d"><li fid="u4a8359da" data-lake-id="ua9f51391" id="ua9f51391"><span data-lake-id="u37368283" id="u37368283">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BQR%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%5ER%20n_h%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_c'%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F585cfdd09ec5c8ec789ab2ee67294a22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cghQD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3659b058" id="u3659b058">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5E%7BKR%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_h%5ER%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F522f1c3c62e892aebf2b0b896a70ccab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qfq03%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5130579" id="ub5130579">分别是用于生成解耦查询和键的矩阵；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoPE%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7474f2c4a2ce1cfdd6456b918df70399.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q4ymi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ff7eb07" id="u9ff7eb07">表示应用 RoPE 矩阵的操作；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79b3b3ebbefa177bcb4a0457e76f46e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yMHci%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua48a71d5" id="ua48a71d5">表示拼接操作。在推理过程中，还需要缓存解耦后的键。因此，DeepSeek-V2 所需的 KV 缓存总共包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(d_c%20%2B%20d_h%5ER)l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5fd8b118f559a9109ad945e12077fc82.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ro6pI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd9c2987" id="ucd9c2987">个元素</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="UOLQz" id="UOLQz" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u33f94b9b" id="u33f94b9b">🦆</span><span data-lake-id="ufab1674d" id="ufab1674d"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤𝐌𝐨𝐄: 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐭𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐠 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐭 𝐄𝐜𝐨𝐧𝐨𝐦𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐥 𝐂𝐨𝐬𝐭𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0e213445" id="u0e213445"><strong><span data-lake-id="u940f33c2" id="u940f33c2">DeepSeekMoE 包含两个核心思想：将专家划分为更细的粒度，以实现更高的专家专业化水平和更准确的知识获取；隔离出部分共享专家，以减少路由专家之间的知识冗余。在激活专家参数量和专家总参数量均相同的条件下，DeepSeekMoE 可以大幅优于 GShard等传统 MoE 架构</span></strong></p><ul list="u3bc3d4bd"><li fid="ud64b30a7" data-lake-id="udfd30d35" id="udfd30d35"><span data-lake-id="ub53782cd" id="ub53782cd">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e4aed712f34784d39d10eca50b423ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SvA70%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60504f16" id="u60504f16">为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dQ32U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3461955" id="ud3461955">个 token 的 FFN 输入，则 FFN 输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b7a574ac3c42b6fd1f4250ff9cfe553.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZCCIg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29810db0" id="u29810db0">的计算如下：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf480c247" id="uf480c247" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_s%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7B(s)%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_r%7D%20g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7B(r)%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb439dead72aeef78146a559290227db5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qn0wS%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud7ea9a49" id="ud7ea9a49" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%26%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs_%7Bj%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%201%20%5C%5Cleq%20j%20%5C%5Cleq%20N_r%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%20K_r%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe621283f13420e15ce4b13520eaf3641.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kmmf2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u20638471" id="u20638471" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D_%7Bi%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%5ET%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_i%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbe3dac3f18d0d5b0eb578c8e2d6bca78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vl67g%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u24327f57"><li fid="u9a496584" data-lake-id="u1f771bbe" id="u1f771bbe"><span data-lake-id="ub13af47b" id="ub13af47b">​</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e3da52521345c18a132afaed26e7fa4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wa6Fn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2dcf151" id="uc2dcf151">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b826551404243b2c212bba7e1e99cc4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZA9Fv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcda76c9" id="ufcda76c9">分别表示共享专家和路由专家的数量；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7B(s)%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf511adf1eca8a04e0ab02dfd5955302.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PtTkh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub4ea2f11" id="ub4ea2f11">和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D_%7Bi%7D%5E%7B(r)%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a6bf599b0ffb69e90134634c977e955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IZ28y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf63ac9f0" id="uf63ac9f0">分别表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22URp0b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uebed1fb9" id="uebed1fb9">个共享专家和第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tGTtd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d627dfc" id="u7d627dfc">个路由专家；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28b8cab4b2b0ac3e2cdbcc7ee8f10fcc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fU20f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9171148d" id="u9171148d">表示被激活的路由专家数量；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F833ee9318bf92b409adb9bd06a8bac13.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AJZGL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u620039be" id="u620039be">是第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CXK9A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d029dff" id="u0d029dff">个专家的门控值</span></li><li fid="u9a496584" data-lake-id="u2db52956" id="u2db52956"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pvXu4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf03586d" id="ubf03586d">是 token 与专家之间的亲和度；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aaa2c022e6053f8927d7b2ef42450c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P9Q7x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue50ffcd2" id="ue50ffcd2">是该层中第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zxUze%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u56cc85e4" id="u56cc85e4">个路由专家的质心；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopk%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%20K)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F309a9068640ab746b9af4dc3e93071ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dog28%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u46b8d48e" id="u46b8d48e">表示由第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sSizf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uafaaefbf" id="uafaaefbf">个 token 与所有路由专家之间计算得到的亲和度得分中最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RjKQc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue172ee52" id="ue172ee52">个得分构成的集合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue57dc1c4" id="ue57dc1c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc55436b4" id="uc55436b4">作者设计一种设备受限路由机制，以限制与 MoE 相关的通信成本。采用专家并行时，路由专家会分布在多个设备上。对于每个 token，其与 MoE 相关的通信频次与目标专家所涉及的设备数量成正比</span></strong></p><ul list="ue91e8383"><li fid="u64fc508a" data-lake-id="u303a9e0d" id="u303a9e0d"><span data-lake-id="u0bd76ebb" id="u0bd76ebb">由于 DeepSeekMoE 采用细粒度专家划分，激活专家的数量可能较多，因此在采用专家并行时，与 MoE 相关的通信成本会更高</span></li><li fid="u64fc508a" data-lake-id="u2a95ffeb" id="u2a95ffeb"><span data-lake-id="u47c613a3" id="u47c613a3">对于 DeepSeek-V2，除对路由专家进行朴素的 top-K 选择外，作者还确保每个 token 的目标专家最多分布在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tFs32%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uddd6c237" id="uddd6c237">个设备上。具体而言，对于每个 token，首先选择</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qk9My%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16b12647" id="u16b12647">个设备，这些设备上包含亲和度得分最高的专家。随后，在这</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jeBVg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9dfdd4da" id="u9dfdd4da">个设备上的专家中执行 top-K 选择</span></li><li fid="u64fc508a" data-lake-id="u5477a0cd" id="u5477a0cd"><span data-lake-id="u5f3ab011" id="u5f3ab011">在实践中，作者发现，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%20%5C%5Cgeq%203%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58d8aea3f5c07fe003165866bd4c11f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xFdEQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c9d9f99" id="u1c9d9f99">时，设备受限路由能够取得与不受限制的 top-K 路由大致相当的良好性能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9dd678b9" id="u9dd678b9"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf365a526" id="uf365a526">对于自动学习得到的路由策略，作者考虑负载均衡问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u6da35c03"><li fid="ucc5cef63" data-lake-id="u321c21dc" id="u321c21dc"><span data-lake-id="u62c82262" id="u62c82262">首先，负载不均衡会增加路由坍塌的风险，使部分专家无法得到充分训练和利用。其次，在采用专家并行时，负载不均衡会降低计算效率</span></li><li fid="ucc5cef63" data-lake-id="ub7313d67" id="ub7313d67"><span data-lake-id="u71f1e1ff" id="u71f1e1ff">在 DeepSeek-V2 的训练过程中，作者设计三种辅助损失，分别用于控制专家级负载均衡、设备级负载均衡和通信均衡</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5d81405f" id="u5d81405f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u53bc1437" id="u53bc1437">专家级均衡损失。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u137dc052" id="u137dc052"> 作者采用专家级均衡损失，以降低路由坍塌的风险</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2f63382e" id="u2f63382e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BExpBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_1%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN_r%7D%20f_i%20P_i%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fca641f6b4f76fec58a2bab3b87e0e94d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ctfvX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubac1ebf8" id="ubac1ebf8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BN_r%7D%7BK_r%20T%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctext%7BToken%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20selects%20Expert%20%7D%20i%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F161a6a97e27117622f56cfb47dfcd9e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AR5qR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uee8fccdd" id="uee8fccdd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B25%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F054491cf79a0df08a59f2bbcad787270.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EB78R%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u684ce36e" id="u684ce36e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue998482f" id="ue998482f">设备级均衡损失。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u26c3bbd0" id="u26c3bbd0"> 除专家级均衡损失外，作者还设计设备级均衡损失，以确保不同设备之间的计算均衡。在 DeepSeek-V2 的训练过程中，作者将所有路由专家划分为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hca54%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf2b8f911" id="uf2b8f911">组</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_1%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_2%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F530e0038f6bfe6bbb89f01b44a90e55e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qoiNb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ebd44b4" id="u0ebd44b4">，并将每组部署在一个设备上。设备级均衡损失的计算如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5feb1178" id="u5feb1178" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDevBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_2%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BD%7D%20f_i'%20P_i'%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B26%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc038fe37ef3f86e7981872c9da01d71b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HLHRw%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3c24ca8c" id="u3c24ca8c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i'%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20f_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B27%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21ca742ed75596266e6fff55518525aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QPQn8%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6fefe076" id="u6fefe076" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i'%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20P_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B28%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tVcQG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud90bbf5f" id="ud90bbf5f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f996b13" id="u0f996b13">通信均衡损失。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7cbd1f48" id="u7cbd1f48"> 最后，作者引入通信均衡损失，以确保各设备的通信均衡。尽管设备受限路由机制保证每个设备的发送通信量有界，但如果某个设备接收的 token 数量多于其他设备，实际通信效率仍会受到影响。为缓解这一问题，作者设计如下通信均衡损失</span></p><p data-lake-id="u549daae2" id="u549daae2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCommBal%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha_3%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BD%7D%20f_i''%20P_i''%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B29%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VypLT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2f5ef7b7" id="u2f5ef7b7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_i''%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BD%7D%7BMT%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctext%7BToken%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20is%20sent%20to%20Device%20%7D%20i%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B30%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OOqgR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u143b79a8" id="u143b79a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_i''%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BE%7D_i%7D%20P_j%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B31%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ChA19%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u88c60cfd"><li fid="u856ee9cd" data-lake-id="uf9fab7ce" id="uf9fab7ce"><span data-lake-id="ub41d2a70" id="ub41d2a70">设备受限路由机制确保每个设备最多向其他设备传输</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22MT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2046fd28870fabfa13a945c4ef53aebf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vgJzq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5bf71fce" id="u5bf71fce">个隐藏状态。同时，通信均衡损失用于鼓励每个设备从其他设备接收约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22MT%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2046fd28870fabfa13a945c4ef53aebf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n6LQt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18c76e35" id="u18c76e35">个隐藏状态。通信均衡损失确保设备之间的信息交换均衡，从而促进高效通信</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u454487b4" id="u454487b4"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc48bfd94" id="uc48bfd94">尽管均衡损失旨在促进负载均衡，但需要认识到，它们无法保证严格的负载均衡</span></strong></p><ul list="uf658f564"><li fid="u4f3330c4" data-lake-id="u96a36822" id="u96a36822"><span data-lake-id="u4bb03445" id="u4bb03445">为进一步减少负载不均衡造成的计算浪费，作者在训练过程中引入设备级 token 丢弃策略。该方法首先计算每个设备的平均计算预算，即每个设备的容量因子等于 1.0</span></li><li fid="u4f3330c4" data-lake-id="udfcc3ffa" id="udfcc3ffa"><span data-lake-id="u16328926" id="u16328926">随后，受 Riquelme et al.（2021）的启发，在每个设备上丢弃亲和度得分最低的 token，直至满足计算预算。此外，作者确保约 10% 的训练序列中的 token 始终不会被丢弃。通过这种方式，可以根据效率要求，灵活决定是否在推理过程中丢弃 token，并始终确保训练与推理之间的一致性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u544aed57" id="u544aed57"><br></p>